      "$comment": "jail-v1.md:1445 (§11.2): the observer records the signed raw Linux return: a success is non-negative, a failure is the negated errno (§13.2:1901-1903 keeps that convention out of the shared envelope).",
      "if": {
        "properties": {
          "source": {
            "const": "audit"
